:: Fishing Coast Path Approach Down
<<set $bus to "fishingCoastPathApproach">>
<<effects>>
<<silently>><<dancedifficulty -300 600>><</silently>>
<<if $rng gte 20 and $danceSuccess>>
	당신은 해안로에서 벗어나 절벽 아래로 난 좁은 오솔길로 접어든다. 발길이 고르지 않아 약간 주의가 필요하지만, 무사히 내려간다.
<<else>>
	당신은 해안 산책로에서 벗어나 절벽을 따라 내려가는 오솔길로 접어든다. 흔들리는 돌에 발이 <span class="red">미끄러지며</span> 세게 넘어져 손과 무릎이 까진다.
	<<gpain>><<pain 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Fishing Coast Path Approach]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Coast Path Approach
<<set $bus to "fishingCoastPathApproach">>
<<effects>>
아래쪽으로 튀어나온 낡은 나무 부두는 반쯤 썩어 바람에 삐걱거리며 당장이라도 무너질 것 같다. 부두 위에 서는 것은 위험해 보이지만, 그 앞의 길은 꽤 안전하다.
<br><br>

<<if canStartFishing()>>
	<<fishingRodIcon>><<link [[낚시한다 (0:05)|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "castOut">><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	낚싯대가 있다면, 여기서 물고기를 잡을 수 있을 것이다.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[길을 따라 올라간다 (0:10)|Fishing Coast Path Approach Up]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Coast Path Approach Up
<<set $bus to "fishingCoastPathApproach">>
<<effects>>
<<silently>><<dancedifficulty -300 600>><</silently>>
<<if $rng gte 20 and $danceSuccess>>
	딩신은 절벽 오솔길을 따라 해안로로 올라간다.
<<else>>
	당신은 절벽 오솔길을 올라간다. 반쯤 올라갔을 때 발이 <span class="red">미끄러지며</span> 앞으로 넘어지지만, 아래로 미끄러져 내려가기 전에 양손으로 바닥을 짚어 간신히 몸을 지탱한다.
	<<gpain>><<pain 4>><<gstress>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Coast Path]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>


/* The PC gets sent here any time they start fishing or after an event. From here, they get sent into the wait loop, where events can happen. */
:: Fishing Coast Path Wait
<<run initFishingCoastPath()>>
<<wearActiveFishingRodProp>>

<<set _fishingEditBaitEnabled to true>>
<<fishingLocationDescription $bus>>
<<fishingLocationPopulation $bus>>
<br><br>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
		<<pregnancyPassout "fishingCoastPath">>
	<<else>>
		<<passoutbeach>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $exposed gte 1>>
		<<exhibitionism "coastPathFishing">>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
		<<orgasmFishingCoastPath>>
	<<else>>
		<<fishingCoastPathWaitAmbient>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[입질을 기다린다 (0:05)|Fishing Coast Path Wait Loop]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[떠난다|Fishing Coast Path Approach]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

<<if $options.fishingBaitSelection is "dropdown">>
	<br><br>
	<<baitMobileDropdown>>
<<elseif $options.images isnot 1>>
	<br>
	<<link "미끼 변경">><<run openBaitOverlay()>><</link>>
<</if>>

<<fishingCoastPathDebugLinks>>



:: Fishing Coast Path Wait Loop
<<run V.fishing.waitsSinceLastCatch++>>
<<cleareventpool>>
<<addinlineevent "bite" fishingCatchEventWeight("fishingCoastPath", 8)>>
	<<set $fishingHookedFish to rollFish("fishingCoastPath")>>
	<<set _isPreferredBait to $fishing.currentBait !== undefined && setup.fishing.lootTables.fish[$fishingHookedFish.type].preferredBait is $fishing.currentBait>>
	<<run onBaitLoss()>>
	<<if fishTriggersMinigame($fishingHookedFish)>>
		<<run fishingMinigameStart($fishingHookedFish.type)>>
		<<include "Fishing Coast Path Minigame Loop">>
	<<else>>
		<<= setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name>>【이가】<<if _isPreferredBait>> 탐욕스럽게<</if>> <<if $fishing.currentBait>>미끼를 물면서<<else>>바늘을 물면서<</if>> 낚싯줄이 팽팽해지는 것을 느낀다. 당신은 낚싯줄을 홱 당겨 별다른 씨름 없이 물 밖으로 건져낸다.
		<<onFishCaught>>
		<<fishingCatchFishText $fishingHookedFish>>
		<br><br>

		<<include "Fishing Coast Path Catch">>
	<</if>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "trash" .2>>
	<<set $fishingTrash to rollFishingTrash("fishingCoastPath")>>
	<<include "Fishing Coast Path Trash Catch">>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "clothing" .2>>
	<<set $clothingItem to rollFishingClothing("fishingCoastPath")>>
	<<include "Fishing Coast Path Clothing Catch">>
<</addinlineevent>>

/* Nothing happens, wait loop continues */
<<addinlineevent "wait" 40>>
	<<include "Fishing Coast Path Wait">>
<</addinlineevent>>
<<runeventpool>>


:: Fishing Coast Path Cat Eat
<<effects>>
당신은 입을 크게 벌리고 <<= setup.foodstuff[$fishingHookedFish.type].name>>【을를】 통째로 입 안에 넣는다. <<fishingEatFishTfProgress>><<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "castOut">><</link>>


:: Widgets Fishing Coast Path Wait Flavor [widget]
<<widget "fishingCoastPathWaitAmbient">>
	<<if $fishingAmbientOverride is "throwBack">>
		<<if $fishing.currentBait>>
			물고기를 다시 파도 속으로 던져주고 <<fishingRebaitMid>>
		<<else>>
			물고기를 다시 파도 속으로 던져버린다.
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $fishingAmbientOverride is "stowAway">>
		<<if $fishing.currentBait>>
			물고기를 보관하고 <<fishingRebaitMid>>
		<<else>>
			물고기를 보관한 뒤 낚싯줄을 다시 던진다.
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $fishingAmbientOverride is "reHook">>
		<<if $fishing.currentBait>>
			<<fishingRebaitStart>>
		<<else>>
			낚싯줄에 바늘을 다시 꿰고 물속으로 던진다.
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $fishingAmbientOverride is "keepClothing">>
		<<generalSend "wardrobe" $clothingItem.slot $clothingItem.item.name $clothingItem.colour>>
		<<= $clothingItem.item.name>>의 물기를 짜내고 보관한다.
	<<elseif $fishingAmbientOverride is "tossClothing">>
		<<= $clothingItem.item.name>>의 물기를 짜내고 보관한다. 마을로 돌아가면 버릴 것이다.
		<<unset $fishingAmbientOverride>>
	<<elseif $fishingAmbientOverride is "castOut">>
		물속으로 낚싯줄을 던진다.
	<<else>>
		<<cleareventpool>>
		<<fishingWaitAmbient $bus>>
		<<runeventpool>>
	<</if>>

	<<unset $fishingAmbientOverride>><<unset $clothingItem>>
<</widget>>
